<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1801–1922</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The United <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-great-britain">Kingdom of Great Britain</a> and Ireland was the state created on 1 January 1801 by the Acts of Union, which merged the Kingdom of Great <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> and the Kingdom of Ireland under one parliament at Westminster. It ruled the largest empire of the 19th century. After the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/irish-war-of-independence">Irish War of Independence</a> the Irish Free State left in December 1922, and the remaining state became the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland.</p></div>
